### Owner API — manual smoke test
### VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client. Sign in first, then the
### token flows into every request below.

@host = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "9999999999", "password": "your-password" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Dashboard — portfolio counters + this month's rent position
GET {{host}}/owner/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tenant list — all
GET {{host}}/owner/tenants?page=1&limit=15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tenant list — only this month's unpaid
GET {{host}}/owner/tenants?status=DUE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tenant list — carried-over or past the due day
GET {{host}}/owner/tenants?status=OVERDUE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tenant list — search by name, phone or address
GET {{host}}/owner/tenants?search=rizwan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@tenancyId = paste-a-tenancyId-from-the-list-above

### Tenant detail
GET {{host}}/owner/tenants/{{tenancyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rent ledger
GET {{host}}/owner/tenants/{{tenancyId}}/rent-ledger?page=1&limit=12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Utility readings
GET {{host}}/owner/tenants/{{tenancyId}}/utility-readings?utilityType=ELECTRICITY
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Maintenance requests
GET {{host}}/owner/tenants/{{tenancyId}}/maintenance?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a maintenance request
PATCH {{host}}/owner/maintenance/paste-a-requestId
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "IN_PROGRESS", "note": "Plumber visiting Saturday morning." }

### Record this month's rent (empty body settles the full outstanding amount)
PATCH {{host}}/tenancies/{{tenancyId}}/rent-ledger/paste-a-ledgerId/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Add a utility reading
POST {{host}}/tenancies/{{tenancyId}}/utility-readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "utilityType": "ELECTRICITY", "value": 412, "billAmount": 3100 }

### --- Authorization checks: all four must return 404, never 200 or 403 ---

### Another owner's tenancy
GET {{host}}/owner/tenants/paste-a-tenancyId-you-do-not-own
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Your tenancy, someone else's ledger row
PATCH {{host}}/tenancies/{{tenancyId}}/rent-ledger/paste-a-foreign-ledgerId/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Another owner's maintenance request
PATCH {{host}}/owner/maintenance/paste-a-foreign-requestId
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "RESOLVED" }

### A renter's token on an owner route — expect 403 from RolesGuard
GET {{host}}/owner/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer paste-a-renter-token

### An illegal status move — expect 400 listing the allowed transitions
PATCH {{host}}/owner/maintenance/paste-a-resolved-requestId
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "OPEN" }
